    "body": "## What's Changed\n* chore: deliverToAppSource with the Partner Center productId by @gunnargestsson in https://github.com/businesscentralal/bc-origo-bifrost-attachments/pull/176\n* fix(ci): AppSource self-app gate after release (port of attachments#174) by @gunnargestsson in https://github.com/businesscentralal/bc-origo-bifrost-attachments/pull/177\n* feat(attachments): complete message type contract and discovery (Foundation parity) by @gunnargestsson in https://github.com/businesscentralal/bc-origo-bifrost-attachments/pull/178\n* fix: process linked incoming documents through Data Exchange (#23) by @gunnars-codex-developer[bot] in https://github.com/businesscentralal/bc-origo-bifrost-attachments/pull/179\n* Refresh six help refusal answers after main integration (#160) by @gunnars-codex-developer[bot] in https://github.com/businesscentralal/bc-origo-bifrost-attachments/pull/174\n* fix: address Attachments UAT findings #175 by @gunnars-codex-developer[bot] in https://github.com/businesscentralal/bc-origo-bifrost-attachments/pull/181\n* Fix Data Exchange validation and storage contracts (#168) by @gunnars-codex-developer[bot] in https://github.com/businesscentralal/bc-origo-bifrost-attachments/pull/184\n* fix: refuse Upload.Begin null/empty fileName before storage (#183) by @gunnars-codex-developer[bot] in https://github.com/businesscentralal/bc-origo-bifrost-attachments/pull/185\n* Incremented Version number by +0.0.1 by @github-actions[bot] in https://github.com/businesscentralal/bc-origo-bifrost-attachments/pull/186\n\n## New Contributors\n* @github-actions[bot] made their first contribution in https://github.com/businesscentralal/bc-origo-bifrost-attachments/pull/186\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/businesscentralal/bc-origo-bifrost-attachments/compare/28.3.0...28.3.1",
